OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer treated like
OL,4,A'prisoner', says widow
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ex-professional footballer was
OL,7,Ftreated like a "prisoner" before his
OL,8,Fdeath, his widow has told an inquest.
OL,10,FColin Flatt, 81, was shuffled between
OL,11,Fhealthcare settings before he fell from
OL,12,Fheight on to a glass table at Basildon
OL,13,FHospital in July 2021.
OL,15,FInjuries suffered by the former
OL,16,FSouthend United and Leyton Orient
OL,17,Fstriker ultimately led to his death two
OL,18,Fmonths later, Essex Coroner's Court has
OL,19,Fbeen told.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
