OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer treated like
OL,4,A'prisoner', says widow
OL,5,
OL,6,FMelanie Leahy, his partner of 19 years,
OL,7,Ftold the inquest Flatt had been
OL,8,F"petrified" in the months before his
OL,9,Fdeath, while he was detained by
OL,10,Fdoctors.
